1
00:00:17,392 --> 00:00:18,496
Who gave you the nerve

2
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,720
to sneak into a military camp
in the middle of the night?

3
00:00:20,736 --> 00:00:22,128
You're the fine one to talk.

4
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:23,800
Why did you suddenly quit?

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,320
That's my business.

6
00:00:25,584 --> 00:00:26,830
Do I owe you an explanation?

7
00:00:27,456 --> 00:00:29,230
Did you already find out
that your mother's death...

8
00:00:29,230 --> 00:00:30,190
What is it to you?

9
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:32,900
=Cases Between Us=

10
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:34,976
Young Master Zhao,
you're so easy to fool.

11
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:38,900
=Episode 33=
Didn't you realize

12
00:00:39,408 --> 00:00:41,350
I approached you on purpose
from the get-go?

13
00:00:42,710 --> 00:00:43,840
I'm an illegitimate son.

14
00:00:44,544 --> 00:00:46,560
I graduated top of my class
at the military academy,

15
00:00:46,570 --> 00:00:47,470
yet I was never valued.

16
00:00:47,470 --> 00:00:49,390
I got dumped in Division Four
of Police Department

17
00:00:49,408 --> 00:00:50,550
with a bunch of useless fools.

18
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:52,000
Making a name for myself there
was next to impossible.

19
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,300
But I refused to accept that.

20
00:00:53,312 --> 00:00:54,670
Then you came along.

21
00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:57,240
The son of the Education Minister.

22
00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:58,560
A gift from Heaven.

23
00:00:59,710 --> 00:01:02,350
I used your curiosity against you

24
00:01:03,070 --> 00:01:05,200
and played on your sympathy
with my mother's death.

25
00:01:05,210 --> 00:01:08,280
Also, haven't you noticed that I've been
going after Secretary Xu the whole time

26
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:09,840
during these last few cases?

27
00:01:10,870 --> 00:01:12,040
Because once I cut off

28
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:13,760
General Chen's cash cow,

29
00:01:14,840 --> 00:01:17,120
my father would see me
in a different light.

30
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:23,400
You mean

31
00:01:26,430 --> 00:01:27,560
what we've been through

32
00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:28,640
was part of your plan?

33
00:01:31,070 --> 00:01:32,120
That everything was fake?

34
00:01:41,430 --> 00:01:44,870
The stars on my uniform are real.

35
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:47,760
My father publicly acknowledged me

36
00:01:48,064 --> 00:01:50,384
and made me a division commander.
That's also real.

37
00:01:51,560 --> 00:01:52,430
So tell me,

38
00:01:53,710 --> 00:01:55,200
what's real and what's fake?

39
00:02:00,310 --> 00:02:01,120
Commander Yuan.

40
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,800
You really did think it all through.

41
00:02:09,630 --> 00:02:11,400
Drop the act, Young Master Zhao.

42
00:02:12,590 --> 00:02:13,430
I know you better

43
00:02:13,430 --> 00:02:14,280
than anyone.

44
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:16,750
You're just luckier than I am.

45
00:02:16,750 --> 00:02:17,680
If you were me,

46
00:02:18,190 --> 00:02:19,800
you'd have changed even faster.

47
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:21,520
Without your father,

48
00:02:21,632 --> 00:02:23,630
without your family,
and without your connections,

49
00:02:23,630 --> 00:02:24,870
how would you have become
an investigative consultant?

50
00:02:24,870 --> 00:02:25,800
How would you solve cases?

51
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:27,904
How would you
throw your weight around in Beijing?

52
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,470
Instead of whining,

53
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:33,800
you should've listened to your father

54
00:02:36,430 --> 00:02:38,400
and gone abroad to study.

55
00:02:41,088 --> 00:02:42,960
Then people might
stop looking down on you.

56
00:02:48,030 --> 00:02:48,800
Don't touch him.

57
00:03:08,310 --> 00:03:10,120
For old times' sake,

58
00:03:13,030 --> 00:03:14,280
I'll let this slide.

59
00:03:16,190 --> 00:03:17,310
Next time,

60
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:20,430
I'll deal with you under military law.

61
00:04:03,184 --> 00:04:04,520
What about your mother's death?

62
00:04:06,470 --> 00:04:08,430
Was that part of your plan, too?

63
00:04:20,352 --> 00:04:21,648
You're talking about the radium?

64
00:04:22,190 --> 00:04:23,750
I got the report long ago.

65
00:04:24,750 --> 00:04:25,920
Do you know

66
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:27,510
what its greatest value was?

67
00:04:28,310 --> 00:04:30,430
It gave me leverage against the Japanese

68
00:04:30,830 --> 00:04:32,160
and earned my father's approval.

69
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:43,830
Now it's useless.

70
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:22,680
Young Master,

71
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,240
let's go home.

72
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,750
We've been gone too long.

73
00:05:25,950 --> 00:05:27,120
Master must've noticed by now.

74
00:05:27,830 --> 00:05:29,040
Come take a look.

75
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:30,920
Ziyun House is selling fakes.

76
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:32,430
What makes you say it's fake?

77
00:05:32,950 --> 00:05:34,464
The reign mark was engraved later.

78
00:05:34,470 --> 00:05:35,870
- You think I'm blind?
- Young Master,

79
00:05:35,880 --> 00:05:36,630
don't get involved.

80
00:05:36,630 --> 00:05:39,160
If you can't afford it, just say so.
Don't go around slandering me.

81
00:05:39,184 --> 00:05:40,040
Watch your mouth.

82
00:05:40,160 --> 00:05:40,750
Young Master.

83
00:05:40,750 --> 00:05:42,070
I said what I said. What?

84
00:05:43,070 --> 00:05:44,190
Buy it if you can.

85
00:05:44,190 --> 00:05:45,000
Otherwise, get lost.

86
00:05:45,376 --> 00:05:46,040
Master Song.

87
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:46,830
You!

88
00:05:54,070 --> 00:05:55,070
Your forgery skills

89
00:05:55,070 --> 00:05:56,120
are slipping.

90
00:05:56,140 --> 00:05:58,624
The overglaze finish is rough.
Still dare put this on display?

91
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:00,600
Young Master Zhao.

92
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:02,040
Sorry about that, Young Master Zhao.

93
00:06:02,432 --> 00:06:03,750
This did come from the palace.

94
00:06:03,750 --> 00:06:05,120
This junk...

95
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,480
Consider it my gift to you.

96
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:09,830
From now on,

97
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:11,920
if anyone dares

98
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:13,000
pass off junk like this

99
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:13,950
to fool people,

100
00:06:15,310 --> 00:06:17,120
this is what they'll get.

101
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:24,430
Zhao Shaoshang!

102
00:06:26,950 --> 00:06:28,390
You've gone too far.

103
00:06:28,624 --> 00:06:30,240
You think Liulichang Antique Market

104
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:31,680
is your backyard?

105
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,270
Folks,

106
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:37,240
let's settle this today.

107
00:06:37,390 --> 00:06:38,240
He has bullied us

108
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:40,160
for years.

109
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:41,750
You. You.

110
00:06:41,750 --> 00:06:42,720
And you.

111
00:06:43,510 --> 00:06:46,190
If it weren't for Minister Zhao,

112
00:06:46,190 --> 00:06:47,360
who would put up

113
00:06:47,750 --> 00:06:48,680
with this spoiled brat?

114
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:49,800
Am I right?

115
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:50,830
- That's right.
- Yes.

116
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:55,720
You believe whatever he says

117
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:57,310
about the antique.

118
00:06:57,510 --> 00:06:58,600
Do you really think

119
00:06:58,830 --> 00:07:00,430
he's an expert?

120
00:07:00,830 --> 00:07:01,560
Let's be honest.

121
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:04,270
People only play along
because they're afraid of his father.

122
00:07:04,870 --> 00:07:06,190
Then maybe my Han jade cups

123
00:07:06,750 --> 00:07:07,800
are the real deal?

124
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:09,120
Actually, I had doubts

125
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:10,480
about that incense burner

126
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:12,190
he appraised.

127
00:07:12,304 --> 00:07:13,760
That's not what you all used to say.

128
00:07:13,770 --> 00:07:15,720
You all said the Young Master
has got a sharp eye.

129
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:16,430
Gentlemen.

130
00:07:21,190 --> 00:07:22,160
You've all been

131
00:07:23,430 --> 00:07:25,480
playing me for a fool, haven't you?

132
00:07:31,870 --> 00:07:32,310
Come.

133
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:34,040
Bring me every antique

134
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:35,000
I've appraised.

135
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:38,040
If I get one wrong,

136
00:07:39,830 --> 00:07:40,950
I'll pay back tenfold.

137
00:07:52,070 --> 00:07:53,480
He's unbelievable.

138
00:08:01,310 --> 00:08:02,310
Talk to him nicely

139
00:08:02,310 --> 00:08:03,800
when Shaoshang gets back.

140
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:05,680
Stop scolding or beating him
all the time.

141
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:07,480
Isn't this the fine son you raised?

142
00:08:07,712 --> 00:08:09,040
If you don't straighten him out,

143
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:10,510
he'll be completely out of control.

144
00:08:10,520 --> 00:08:11,904
What's wrong with how I raised him?

145
00:08:14,510 --> 00:08:15,240
Shaoshang.

146
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:17,480
Shaoshang.

147
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:18,390
Mother.

148
00:08:18,390 --> 00:08:19,720
You're finally home, Shaoshang.

149
00:08:20,240 --> 00:08:20,630
Father.

150
00:08:20,630 --> 00:08:22,750
Where have you been these past few days?

151
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:25,950
Bring me the cane.

152
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:26,830
Father.

153
00:08:26,830 --> 00:08:27,750
Chengru.

154
00:08:28,512 --> 00:08:30,032
I've decided to study abroad.

155
00:08:35,936 --> 00:08:37,264
I've come to my senses.

156
00:08:39,550 --> 00:08:41,480
I've been useless long enough.

157
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:43,630
It's time

158
00:08:44,790 --> 00:08:46,000
I got my act together,

159
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:49,270
so no one can

160
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:51,030
look down on me again.

161
00:08:55,552 --> 00:08:56,870
- Listen.
- Father, Mother.

162
00:08:56,870 --> 00:08:58,790
I know you've always wanted
what's best for me.

163
00:08:59,390 --> 00:09:00,240
This time,

164
00:09:02,544 --> 00:09:04,270
I'm doing it because I truly want to.

165
00:09:07,790 --> 00:09:10,440
Shaoshang has really grown up.

166
00:09:17,550 --> 00:09:18,200
Let's eat.

167
00:09:18,350 --> 00:09:18,730
Come on.

168
00:09:18,992 --> 00:09:20,670
Bring the aged liquor I've been saving.

169
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:36,150
Young Master, come on.

170
00:09:38,030 --> 00:09:38,790
Young Master.

171
00:09:42,670 --> 00:09:43,750
Silly puppy.

172
00:09:51,616 --> 00:09:52,670
Dogs understand humans.

173
00:09:52,670 --> 00:09:54,224
It understands what we're talking about.

174
00:09:55,910 --> 00:09:57,510
You like dogs.

175
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:00,270
Dogs

176
00:10:00,670 --> 00:10:02,360
are loyal.

177
00:10:03,088 --> 00:10:05,248
Once they choose a master,
they're loyal for life.

178
00:10:14,790 --> 00:10:15,910
The pickled cabbage hotpot

179
00:10:15,910 --> 00:10:17,360
has been cooking all afternoon.

180
00:10:17,750 --> 00:10:18,150
Come.

181
00:10:18,270 --> 00:10:18,720
Have some.

182
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:21,152
Chinese New Year's Eve
is only two days away.

183
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:23,000
You never spend any time at home.

184
00:10:23,390 --> 00:10:24,030
Can't you stay

185
00:10:24,030 --> 00:10:25,890
and have one proper meal
with Father and Mother?

186
00:10:26,630 --> 00:10:28,870
Do you know what I like most?

187
00:10:29,750 --> 00:10:30,480
Having fun.

188
00:10:31,480 --> 00:10:34,270
The more thrilling, the better.

189
00:10:35,240 --> 00:10:36,270
Nothing else matters.

190
00:10:38,510 --> 00:10:39,510
Let me make this clear.

191
00:10:40,670 --> 00:10:41,870
I'm not doing it for you.

192
00:10:42,840 --> 00:10:46,200
I just like having fun.

193
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:50,550
Mr. Zhao, please take care of yourself.

194
00:10:50,550 --> 00:10:51,480
Cherish your life.

195
00:10:51,824 --> 00:10:52,870
You were lucky to survive

196
00:10:53,320 --> 00:10:55,080
that shootout.

197
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:56,750
Keep up the good work.

198
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:57,910
We're counting on you.

199
00:11:09,080 --> 00:11:10,550
Father, Mother.

200
00:11:11,670 --> 00:11:12,600
I'll stay home

201
00:11:12,864 --> 00:11:15,184
and have a reunion dinner together
on the Eve.

202
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:38,320
Coming.

203
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:39,720
Who is it this early?

204
00:11:39,750 --> 00:11:40,270
Open up.

205
00:11:40,270 --> 00:11:41,320
Police.

206
00:11:42,360 --> 00:11:43,200
What is this about?

207
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:44,550
Just open the door.

208
00:11:44,550 --> 00:11:45,510
Enough talking.

209
00:11:45,510 --> 00:11:46,200
Open up!

210
00:11:51,440 --> 00:11:51,960
Go.

211
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:53,390
What's going on?

212
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:56,120
Young Master!

213
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:01,120
Chengru!

214
00:12:01,390 --> 00:12:02,320
Chengru!

215
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:04,670
My husband is the Minister of Education.

216
00:12:04,670 --> 00:12:05,630
You can't arrest him

217
00:12:05,630 --> 00:12:07,720
without evidence!

218
00:12:07,790 --> 00:12:10,240
Chengru!

219
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:11,088
Let him go!

220
00:12:11,088 --> 00:12:12,670
Mother. Have you no respect for the law?

221
00:12:12,670 --> 00:12:15,190
Zhao Chengru is suspected of colluding
with a former Qing dynasty eunuch

222
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:16,440
to traffic palace antiques.

223
00:12:16,440 --> 00:12:17,720
He is to be arrested immediately.

224
00:12:17,720 --> 00:12:19,150
That's impossible.

225
00:12:19,664 --> 00:12:20,480
What has happened?

226
00:12:21,030 --> 00:12:22,000
What's going on?

227
00:12:23,240 --> 00:12:24,016
Young Master Zhao,

228
00:12:24,120 --> 00:12:25,320
I'm sorry.

229
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:26,750
Seal the premises.

230
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:28,960
No one in the household,
including the servants,

231
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:30,360
is allowed to leave Beijing.

232
00:12:30,480 --> 00:12:31,750
Inventory

233
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:33,240
all family assets.

234
00:12:33,240 --> 00:12:34,290
Nothing is to be moved.

235
00:12:34,304 --> 00:12:34,880
Father.

236
00:12:35,696 --> 00:12:36,720
Don't do anything rash.

237
00:12:36,944 --> 00:12:38,080
Take care of your mother.

238
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:38,840
Chengru.

239
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:40,550
I'll go with you.

240
00:12:41,120 --> 00:12:42,600
But leave my family out of this.

241
00:12:43,840 --> 00:12:44,390
Take him away.

242
00:12:44,550 --> 00:12:46,030
This has to be a mistake!

243
00:12:46,030 --> 00:12:47,550
Chengru!

244
00:12:48,510 --> 00:12:48,870
Mother!

245
00:12:48,870 --> 00:12:49,960
- Madam!
- Madam!

246
00:12:50,016 --> 00:12:51,320
Mother! Are you alright, Mother?

247
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:52,960
Mother! Don't scare me, Mother!

248
00:12:53,270 --> 00:12:54,200
Mother, wake up!

249
00:12:54,496 --> 00:12:55,600
What are you waiting for?

250
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:56,840
Send Mother to the hospital.

251
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:57,630
Mother!

252
00:12:58,360 --> 00:12:58,960
Mother!

253
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:05,030
This is outrageous.

254
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:06,910
That scoundrel Chen

255
00:13:06,910 --> 00:13:08,840
actually dared to steal from the palace.

256
00:13:09,840 --> 00:13:11,840
They say the British are behind it.

257
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:13,960
So what if the British are backing him?

258
00:13:14,030 --> 00:13:16,000
He really thinks he's untouchable?

259
00:13:16,630 --> 00:13:17,270
What they want

260
00:13:17,270 --> 00:13:19,680
is the imperial antiques General Chen
stole from the palace.

261
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:25,200
How many weapons can it be traded for?

262
00:13:28,688 --> 00:13:30,128
Enough to arm five divisions.

263
00:13:30,510 --> 00:13:32,200
The latest guns and artillery.

264
00:13:32,870 --> 00:13:33,510
Sir!

265
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:39,750
Come in.

266
00:13:46,240 --> 00:13:47,120
Adjutant Sun,

267
00:13:47,390 --> 00:13:50,510
don't you think

268
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:52,390
this uniform suits him perfectly?

269
00:13:53,320 --> 00:13:53,870
Yes.

270
00:14:05,200 --> 00:14:08,440
How much of what I just said
to Adjutant Sun

271
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:10,600
did you overhear?

272
00:14:12,440 --> 00:14:13,750
I only came to report for duty.

273
00:14:13,872 --> 00:14:15,472
I had no intention of listening in.

274
00:14:17,910 --> 00:14:21,600
That Chen fellow is handing
the Forbidden City's treasures

275
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:24,000
to the British.

276
00:14:24,840 --> 00:14:26,670
What do you make of that?

277
00:14:28,864 --> 00:14:31,410
He's making quite a generous gift
with someone else's property.

278
00:14:31,480 --> 00:14:32,360
Bold move.

279
00:14:36,030 --> 00:14:37,960
With Zhao Chengru taking the fall,

280
00:14:38,270 --> 00:14:39,440
what does he have to fear?

281
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:44,960
If I remember correctly,

282
00:14:44,960 --> 00:14:46,750
the calligraphy in your study

283
00:14:47,870 --> 00:14:50,120
is Man Jiang Hong by Yue Wumu.

284
00:14:51,390 --> 00:14:52,320
That's right.

285
00:14:52,832 --> 00:14:55,072
"The shame of the Jingkang incident
is yet to be avenged.

286
00:14:55,120 --> 00:14:57,030
When will a loyal subject's hatred
be erased?"

287
00:14:57,200 --> 00:14:59,664
The treasures looted
by the Eight-Nation Alliance

288
00:15:00,240 --> 00:15:03,000
are now being handed over
by our own people.

289
00:15:05,480 --> 00:15:07,390
What would you do then?

290
00:15:09,270 --> 00:15:10,320
You taught me

291
00:15:10,960 --> 00:15:12,720
that a soldier's duty
is to defend the land.

292
00:15:13,030 --> 00:15:15,150
Not just its borders,

293
00:15:15,870 --> 00:15:17,150
but its cultural heritage.

294
00:15:22,480 --> 00:15:23,270
Good.

295
00:15:26,150 --> 00:15:27,030
Very good.

296
00:15:29,270 --> 00:15:30,510
I'm putting you

297
00:15:31,120 --> 00:15:33,150
in charge of this.

298
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:37,910
Bring every last treasure back.

299
00:15:38,270 --> 00:15:40,440
Not a single piece can be missing.

300
00:15:42,960 --> 00:15:43,510
Yes, sir.

301
00:16:10,080 --> 00:16:10,870
Marshal,

302
00:16:11,088 --> 00:16:13,030
Young Master is close
to Young Master Zhao.

303
00:16:16,870 --> 00:16:19,600
He volunteered to return to the army.

304
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:23,960
Does he think I can't see through him?

305
00:16:28,080 --> 00:16:30,510
This time, I want to see

306
00:16:31,200 --> 00:16:34,960
how loyal he is to me.

307
00:16:43,150 --> 00:16:44,000
How is Mother?

308
00:16:45,080 --> 00:16:46,630
Dr. Du says it's a heart attack.

309
00:16:46,630 --> 00:16:47,790
She is still unconscious.

310
00:16:48,080 --> 00:16:49,390
Now it's in Heaven's hands.

311
00:16:49,390 --> 00:16:50,630
If she wakes up, she'll be fine.

312
00:16:52,630 --> 00:16:53,670
Why are you here alone?

313
00:16:53,670 --> 00:16:54,750
Where are the maids?

314
00:16:55,630 --> 00:16:56,440
They all left.

315
00:16:56,672 --> 00:16:58,410
They're afraid
of getting dragged into this.

316
00:16:58,416 --> 00:16:59,490
They said they had family matters.

317
00:16:59,510 --> 00:17:01,800
When the tree falls, the monkeys
scatter. That's only human.

318
00:17:01,840 --> 00:17:02,360
Any news

319
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:03,600
about Father?

320
00:17:03,664 --> 00:17:04,380
He has been accused

321
00:17:04,390 --> 00:17:06,680
of colluding with the former
Qing dynasty eunuch, Zhang Delu,

322
00:17:06,680 --> 00:17:07,750
to traffic imperial antiques.

323
00:17:07,750 --> 00:17:09,390
Ridiculous.
Father would never do that...

324
00:17:09,408 --> 00:17:10,288
They have evidence.

325
00:17:10,368 --> 00:17:12,384
After Zhang Delu was arrested,
he gave Father up

326
00:17:12,550 --> 00:17:13,640
and handed over

327
00:17:13,760 --> 00:17:16,260
the imperial jade thumb ring
granted by the Qianlong Emperor.

328
00:17:16,270 --> 00:17:17,100
That thumb ring...

329
00:17:17,120 --> 00:17:19,360
The one I traded away
for four crickets when I was eight.

330
00:17:19,824 --> 00:17:21,400
Who would dare admit they had lost it?

331
00:17:21,750 --> 00:17:23,790
For him to bring it up now,
he must know the truth.

332
00:17:23,790 --> 00:17:25,030
He caught us off guard.

333
00:17:31,310 --> 00:17:32,590
It's a setup.

334
00:17:32,590 --> 00:17:33,880
The thumb ring is with me.

335
00:17:33,880 --> 00:17:34,920
Right after you got conned,

336
00:17:34,920 --> 00:17:35,790
I beat them up

337
00:17:35,790 --> 00:17:37,110
and got it back.

338
00:17:37,664 --> 00:17:39,310
Why didn't you tell me all these years?

339
00:17:39,310 --> 00:17:40,790
I wanted you to learn your lesson.

340
00:17:41,030 --> 00:17:42,440
Who knew it would come to this?

341
00:17:43,510 --> 00:17:44,350
But even if we prove

342
00:17:44,350 --> 00:17:45,824
the thumb ring is fake,

343
00:17:46,060 --> 00:17:48,000
if the missing palace treasures
aren't recovered,

344
00:17:48,016 --> 00:17:49,568
Father still can't clear his name.

345
00:17:49,792 --> 00:17:51,632
It's true that
the treasures are missing.

346
00:17:52,640 --> 00:17:53,240
But strangely,

347
00:17:53,240 --> 00:17:55,280
there's not a whisper
about them on the market.

348
00:17:55,392 --> 00:17:56,920
I'm going to Liulichang Antique Market.

349
00:17:57,024 --> 00:17:58,260
There may still be a way out.

350
00:17:58,410 --> 00:17:59,390
If someone's behind this,

351
00:17:59,400 --> 00:18:00,670
it's too dangerous for you to go.

352
00:18:00,680 --> 00:18:02,160
Liulichang Antique Market is my turf.

353
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:03,400
Don't worry.

354
00:18:15,790 --> 00:18:16,830
Master Song.

355
00:18:21,030 --> 00:18:22,270
Young Master Zhao,

356
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:25,680
do you still have the mood
to visit my shop?

357
00:18:26,680 --> 00:18:27,750
Did those palace treasures

358
00:18:28,160 --> 00:18:29,400
pass through your hands?

359
00:18:38,510 --> 00:18:39,550
Yesterday,

360
00:18:41,680 --> 00:18:43,350
you were so full of yourself

361
00:18:44,110 --> 00:18:45,550
when you smashed my goods.

362
00:18:46,310 --> 00:18:46,960
What?

363
00:18:47,270 --> 00:18:47,960
Today,

364
00:18:48,640 --> 00:18:50,208
you're here asking me for help?

365
00:18:50,340 --> 00:18:53,080
(End of Episode 33)

366
00:18:53,360 --> 00:18:55,000
♪Side by side,
we journey through this life♪

367
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:56,540
♪Troubled times
are but a laughing matter♪

368
00:18:56,540 --> 00:18:57,790
♪However, the world changes♪

369
00:18:57,790 --> 00:18:59,710
♪You'll still be by my side♪

370
00:18:59,710 --> 00:19:01,400
♪Side by side,
we journey through this life♪

371
00:19:01,400 --> 00:19:02,970
♪Praise and blame come and go♪

372
00:19:02,970 --> 00:19:04,540
♪If this is my final chapter♪

373
00:19:04,540 --> 00:19:07,040
♪I'll solve this mystery with you♪
